harness gate — Phase gates — submit artifacts, then a human approves.

Subcommands:
  submit <P> --paths <a,b> [--evidence claimed|code|measured]
                                  Submit artifacts for review; pins their hash and writes a review packet. Rejects empty or placeholder artifacts, and content that already opened another gate.
  approve <P>                     Approve a submitted gate. Humans only — never an agent.
  verify <P>                      Re-check that submitted artifacts still match their pinned hash.
  sweep                           Invalidate gates whose artifacts changed after approval.
  status                          Print all gate records as JSON.
  feedback <P> [--from <file>]    Collect reviewer/canvas comments as revision grounds; without --from, print what was collected.
